---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About · Jia Dodeja">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap about-inner">
      <div class="about-photo">
        <span>your photo</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <p class="label">About</p>
        <p>
          I'm Jia, a CS major (minor in Innovation and Entrepreneurship) at NJIT, currently a
          rising senior. I mostly build full-stack applications, comfortable across the stack
          from Next.js and React to backend work with Supabase, Prisma, and various AI APIs —
          though not everything I build is AI-flavored.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've been to HackPrinceton twice, and I'm always looking for a team working on
          something that actually matters, especially around accessibility or women's health.
          I'm also genuinely open to education, entertainment, or just anything fun, and would
          love to try something slightly outside my comfort zone, like a hardware-integrated
          build, if the team needs a software or full-stack teammate.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside of code, I've got a soft spot for flowers and butterflies, I'm always up for
          trying a new restaurant, and I'm a bit of a cinephile. I love color and vibrancy in
          just about everything, which probably explains why this site isn't just black and
          white.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .about-inner {
      display: flex;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .about-photo {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 160px;
      height: 160px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 2px solid var(--terracotta-light);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--border-warm);
    }
    .about-text p {
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .about-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
